<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Legal Xchange</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f2f4f7;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background: #1a237e;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav {
            background: #0d133d;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        nav a {
            color: white;
            margin: 0 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        section {
            padding: 30px 15px;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #1a237e;
        }
        ul li {
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .btn {
            display: block;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 300px;
            margin: 15px auto;
            background: #1a237e;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .btn.whatsapp {
            background: #25D366;
        }
        footer {
            background: #1a237e;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>Legal Xchange</h1>
    <p>Trusted Platform for Social Logs & Global Verification Numbers</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
    <h2>Welcome to Legal Xchange</h2>
    <p>
        Legal Xchange is a digital platform where users can access
        social logs and all-country phone numbers for one-time
        verification purposes. We focus on fast delivery, privacy,
        and reliability.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="services">
    <h2>What We Offer</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Social logs access</li>
        <li>All-country phone numbers</li>
        <li>One-time verification (OTP)</li>
        <li>Fast and secure service</li>
    </ul>

    <a class="btn whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/234XXXXXXXXX" target="_blank">
        Contact on WhatsApp
    </a>

    <a class="btn" href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/YOURCHANNELINVITELINK" target="_blank">
        Join WhatsApp Channel
    </a>
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +234 XXX XXX XXXX</p>
    <p><strong>Service:</strong> Online / Worldwide</p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Legal Xchange. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>